        "The OIC Fiqh Council (8th session, 1993) permits changing the settlement currency of a debt only by mutual agreement made ON THE DAY OF SETTLEMENT itself, at that day's prevailing exchange rate -- not pre-agreed in advance to a fixed alternate-currency value."
